070"]},{"id":"luxun-m-o071-luxun-p0051","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["luxun-q-o071"]},{"id":"luxun-m-o074-luxun-p0051","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["luxun-q-o074"]},{"id":"luxun-m-o075-luxun-p0051","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["luxun-q-o075"]},{"id":"luxun-m-p018-luxun-p0051","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["luxun-q-p018"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"luxun-e-o068a-q","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-a3ef184ac0e374dc2457","layer":"original","quote":"凤皇元年，西陵督步阐据城以叛〖1〗，遣使降晋。","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":345,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":23,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"luxun-e-o075a-q","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-4a26ea8a0f80eb1773d2","layer":"original","quote":"抗遂陷西陵城；诛夷阐族及其大将吏，自此以下，所请赦者数万口。修治城围，东还乐乡；貌无矜色，谦冲如常，故得将士欢心。","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":352,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":57,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"luxun-q-o068","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-a3ef184ac0e374dc2457","layer":"original","quote":"凤皇元年，西陵督步阐据城以叛〖1〗，遣使降晋。抗闻之日，部分诸军，令将军左奕、吾彦、蔡贡等径赴西陵。敕军营：更筑严围〖2〗，自赤溪至故市〖3〗；内以围阐，外以御寇。昼夜催切，如敌已至，众甚苦之。诸将咸谏曰：“今及三军之锐，亟以攻阐〖4〗；比晋救至〖5〗，阐必可拔。何事于围〖6〗，而以弊士民之力乎？”","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":345,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":150,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"luxun-q-o069","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-41a01d52d421e25bcdd0","layer":"original","quote":"抗曰：“此城处势既固，粮谷又足；且所缮修备御之具，皆抗所宿规〖7〗。今反身攻之，既非可猝克，且北救必至；至而无备，表里受难，何以御之？”","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":346,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":68,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"luxun-q-o070","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-ac63c1c2d7a97f3bb382","layer":"original","quote":"诸将咸欲攻阐，抗每不许。宜都太守雷谭，言至恳切；抗欲服众，听令一攻：攻果无利。","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":347,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":39,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"luxun-q-o071","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-94f14aac77ba81b02a56","layer":"original","quote":"围备始合，晋车骑将军羊祜率师向江陵；诸将咸以抗不宜上〖8〗，抗曰：“江陵城固兵足，无所忧患。假令敌没江陵，必不能守，所损者小。如使西陵盘结〖9〗，则南山群夷皆当扰动；则所忧虑，难可竟言也！吾宁弃江陵而赴西陵，况江陵牢固乎？”","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":348,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":112,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"luxun-q-o074","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-076b63a347bfe52cc440","layer":"original","quote":"明日，肇果攻故夷兵处，抗命旋军击之；矢石雨下，肇众伤死者相属。肇至经月，计屈夜遁。抗欲追之，而虑阐蓄力项领〖16〗，伺视间隙，兵不足分；于是但鸣鼓戒众〖17〗，若将追者。肇众汹惧〖18〗，悉解甲挺走〖19〗。抗使轻兵蹑之〖20〗，肇大破败。祜等皆引军还。","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":351,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":127,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"luxun-q-o075","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-4a26ea8a0f80eb1773d2","layer":"original","quote":"抗遂陷西陵城；诛夷阐族及其大将吏，自此以下，所请赦者数万口。修治城围，东还乐乡；貌无矜色，谦冲如常，故得将士欢心。﹝一﹞加拜都护。","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":352,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":65,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"luxun-q-p018","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-20b860773c1dd9d264dc","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞景弟机，字士衡；云，字士龙。《机云别传》曰：“晋太康末，俱入洛，造司空张华。华一见而奇之，曰：‘伐吴之役，利在获二俊。’遂为之延誉，荐之诸公。太傅杨骏辟机为祭酒。转太子洗马，尚书著作郎。云为吴王郎中令。出宰浚仪，甚有惠政，吏民怀之，生为立祠。后并历显位。机天才绮练，文藻之美，独冠于时。云亦善属文，清新不及机，而口辩持论，过之。于时朝廷多故，机、云并自结于成都王颖。颖用机为平原相，云清河内史。寻转云右司马，甚见委仗。无几而与长沙王构隙，遂举兵攻洛。以机行后将军，督王粹、牵秀等诸军二十万；士龙著《南征赋》以美其事。机，吴人，羇旅单宦；顿居群士之右，多不厌服。机屡战失利，死散过半。初，宦人孟玖，颖所嬖幸，乘宠预权。云数言其短，颖不能纳；玖又从而毁之。是役也，玖弟超，亦领众配机，不奉军令。机绳之以法，超宣言曰‘陆机将反’。及牵秀等谮机于颖，以为持两端；玖又构之于内：颖信之。遣收机，并收云及弟耽，并伏法。机兄弟既江南之秀，亦著名诸夏；并以无罪夷灭，天下痛惜之。机文章为世所重，云所著亦传于世。初，抗之克步阐也，诛及婴孩。识道者尤之曰：‘后世必受其殃！’及机之诛，三族无遗。孙惠与朱诞书曰：‘马援择君，凡人所闻。不意三陆，相携暴朝；杀身伤名，可为悼叹！’”事亦并在《晋书》。","attribution":"《机云别传》及裴注","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":454,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-d3a7d3771e82327ad7c0","start":0,"end":540,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"panlu-q-755a7dc1ed32345c24fc","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-ccd2ca2f368117883cd0","layer":"original","quote":"皓徙都武昌；扬土百姓溯流供给〖1〗，以为患苦。又政事多谬，黎元穷匮","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":60,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":33,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu-q-405921228f49f9bf2841","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-ad64edf1bd4ad11e3e6d","layer":"original","quote":"九月，从西陵督步阐表〖7〗，徙都武昌","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":329,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":18,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu-q-72dd776e7f89a6336198","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-fa0fe4a3ed8ad4520955","layer":"original","quote":"阐不应，据城降晋","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":425,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":18,"end":26,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu-q-80ee6367666afec118f6","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-fa0fe4a3ed8ad4520955","layer":"original","quote":"遣乐乡都督陆抗围取阐〖2〗，阐众悉降","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":425,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":27,"end":45,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu-q-ff8fe15408019015c60f","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-fa0fe4a3ed8ad4520955","layer":"original","quote":"阐及同计数十人，皆夷三族","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":425,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":46,"end":58,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-12a904f491b9d053a45f","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-abb819d300d36cb02c9f","layer":"original","quote":"孙皓使陆抗西行，祜等遁退。抗陷城，斩阐等。步氏泯灭，惟璿绍祀","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":456,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":30,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-4acf253b0fadb603e733","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-6eacaf4bfffaf4f6febd","layer":"original","quote":"子协嗣，统骘所领，加抚军将军。协卒，子玑嗣侯。协弟阐，继业为西陵督；加昭武将军〖4〗，封西亭侯","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":454,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":47,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-4e6bf5ff89170aad6e55","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-924121af7bdd349c256c","layer":"original","quote":"凤凰元年，召为绕帐督。阐累世在西陵，猝被征命，自以失职，又惧有谗祸；于是据城降晋，遣玑弟璿诣洛阳为任〖5〗。晋以阐为都督西陵诸军事，卫将军，仪同三司，加侍中，假节，领交州牧，封宜都公〖6〗；玑监江陵诸军事，左将军，加散骑常侍，领（庐陵）〔庐江〕太守，改封江陵侯；璿给事中，宣威将军〖7〗，封都乡侯。命车骑将军羊祜、荆州刺史杨肇，往赴救阐","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":455,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":168,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{"luxun-p0051":{"fields":[],"directory":{"faction":"wu"}}},"directory_counts":{}}
